# Task 145-010 Execution Plan

## Goal
Replace hardcoded DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS in 3 spawn backends with adaptive timeout from brainEstimateTimeout().

## Changes

### 1. src/orchestra/spawn-backend-docker.ts
- Add `/** @deprecated */` comment to DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS constant
- Modify worker.sh template: use `TIMEOUT=${TASK_TIMEOUT:-1200}` instead of hardcoded `timeout 1200`
- Add TASK_TIMEOUT env var to docker run args (passed via SpawnBackendOptions or constructor)

### 2. src/orchestra/tmux.ts
- Add `/** @deprecated */` comment to WORKER_TIMEOUT_SECONDS
